            <ArticleTitle>[Giant hemangioma of the liver revealed by an inflammatory syndrome].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>93-5</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>We report two cases of giant hemangioma of the liver revealed by a clinico-biological syndrome including fever, right upper quadrant pain and a biological inflammatory syndrome, whereas liver function tests and blood cell count were normal. This clinical presentation may help in the diagnosis of giant hemangioma of the liver.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
